      "short": "$\\$300$. The additional $\\$90$ represents $75\\%-45\\%=30\\%$ of the cost.",
      "worked": "The additional $\\$90$ represents $75\\%-45\\%=30\\%$ of the cost.\n$$\\begin{align*}30\\%&=\\$90\\\\10\\%&=\\$90\\div3\\\\&=\\$30\\\\100\\%&=\\$30\\times10\\\\&=\\$300\\end{align*}$$\nThe bat costs $\\$300$.",
